WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.122 --> 00:00:18.962
That was easy.

2
00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:21.565
Brad: We're lucky no one noticed us.

3
00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:26.329
Danny: I think the mites are too busy to notice anything.

4
00:00:26.349 --> 00:00:29.592
Brad: They're turning around!

5
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.622
Let's get to that bench before they notice us.

6
00:00:33.642 --> 00:00:37.626
Danny: Get down and crawl.

7
00:00:37.646 --> 00:00:39.588
Brad: Whatever you say!

8
00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:46.935
Danny: The mites are everywhere.

9
00:00:47.776 --> 00:00:49.277
We need another distraction.

10
00:00:49.297 --> 00:00:51.679
Brad: I don't have my computer.

11
00:01:00.752 --> 00:01:02.133
Danny: We don't need your computer.

12
00:01:03.213 --> 00:01:04.034
I've got a plan.

13
00:01:04.054 --> 00:01:06.515
Brad: What are you going to do with that?

14
00:01:06.535 --> 00:01:09.977
Danny: I'm going to throw this stone and hit that bell.

15
00:01:09.997 --> 00:01:11.678
Brad: Where?

16
00:01:11.698 --> 00:01:17.782
Brad: There's no way you can hit that!

17
00:01:17.802 --> 00:01:20.904
Danny: I just have to visualize my throw first.

18
00:01:21.644 --> 00:01:22.325
That's the key.

19
00:01:22.345 --> 00:01:26.347
Brad: You mean you are going to use your imagination?

20
00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.808
Danny: Exactly!

21
00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:33.164
Danny: I just need one huge, super-strong throw.

22
00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:44.257
Um Danny?

23
00:01:44.277 --> 00:01:45.499
Danny: What?

24
00:01:45.519 --> 00:01:47.662
Brad: You should throw the rock soon.

25
00:01:47.682 --> 00:01:49.424
Danny: Oh yeah, right.

26
00:02:02.028 --> 00:02:02.528
Brad: You did it!

27
00:02:02.548 --> 00:02:06.931
Danny: It was not exactly the way I imagined, but it worked.

28
00:02:07.571 --> 00:02:09.752
Brad: Let's rescue Chuck and Dave!

29
00:02:16.556 --> 00:02:17.396
This is weird.

30
00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:18.657
Danny: What?

31
00:02:18.677 --> 00:02:21.798
Brad: This tower is completely deserted.

32
00:02:21.818 --> 00:02:24.380
Brad: I was sure there would be guards here.

33
00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.461
Danny: Don't complain because it's easy.

34
00:02:28.262 --> 00:02:29.082
I like easy!

35
00:02:29.102 --> 00:02:30.583
Brad: Okay.

36
00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:31.904
Let's keep climbing!

37
00:02:32.576 --> 00:02:34.277
Danny: Last one up is a rotten egg!

38
00:02:34.317 --> 00:02:42.642
Danny: You don't suppose it's open, do you?

39
00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:43.962
Brad: I wish.

40
00:02:43.982 --> 00:02:46.824
Brad: It's open!

41
00:02:46.844 --> 00:02:49.145
Danny: It's time to be heroes.

42
00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:58.350
They're not there!

43
00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.832
Brad: They must be in another tower!

44
00:03:04.204 --> 00:03:05.666
Danny: Which tower are they in?

45
00:03:05.686 --> 00:03:08.969
Brad: They aren't in a tower anymore.

46
00:03:08.989 --> 00:03:11.091
Danny: How do you know that?

47
00:03:11.111 --> 00:03:11.912
Brad: Look!

48
00:03:12.012 --> 00:03:14.775
Danny: What's going on down there?

49
00:03:18.679 --> 00:03:20.981
The mites are giving Chuck and Dave to those ants!

50
00:03:21.001 --> 00:03:24.645
Danny: What are the ants going to do with them?

51
00:03:24.665 --> 00:03:26.687
Brad: I don't know!
